title: "Spatial Sampling Framework for Dental Facilities — Riyadh"
abstract: >-
  Field-validated census data and R analysis code for a spatially explicit sampling
  frame of private dental facilities in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, supporting the manuscript
  "Validating Dental Sampling Frames in Rapidly Expanding Cities: Riyadh Case."
type: dataset
